l</strong></h2>All the enemies in the game: if you can defeat the special one, you will remember the Instant Kill method once you encounter them again or; with the enemies of the same kind, you will be able to handle them in a single stretch.<br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/822030/extras/4999dec99e6e0a9fc34b398732f46c40.poster.avif?t=1601952065\" width=424 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/822030/extras/4999dec99e6e0a9fc34b398732f46c40.webm?t=1601952065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/822030/extras/4999dec99e6e0a9fc34b398732f46c40.mp4?t=1601952065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Enemy Sudden Attack</strong><br>Another form of enemies\u2019 attack is the sudden attack. It has extra high speed, although it is done one time at a sitting. The defense for this is the same way as the combo attack.<br><br><br><br><br>","developers":["Select Start"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/822030/header.jpg?t=1601952065","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.11 and above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 GPU, 1GB of VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1000 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any supported by the OS</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/822030/316744/491d74d05ad42af9